' A v1.2 human who dies on the map keeps his next turn (`preset classic ai
' none seed 3 start 2`): he starts in Death Town, gas 95, unprotected, and
' dies at the first day's end (`HazardRules.ApplyDaily`). v1.2 activates his
' client again (`GameServer.cs:59-64`) and `MapScene` ends the turn only on
' the clock or NEXT (`MapScene.cs:441-447`). Here he presses NEXT: the next
' `World.Turn` finds his character dead and puts him out, dismissing his
' people (`World.cs:97-118`): a `defeat` line. Compare
' `v12_dead_turn_enter`.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
day                      ' dies at the day's end
wait 30
day                      ' his own turn, ended
wait 30
quit
